      "startSeconds": 0,
      "text": "What is a virtual environment?"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 1.833,
      "text": "Well this is simply"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 2.966,
      "text": "a self-contained location"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 4.466,
      "text": "that enables you"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 5.066,
      "text": "to maintain separate"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 6.2,
      "text": "and isolated environments"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 7.633,
      "text": "for your Python projects"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 9.366,
      "text": "This isolation"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 10.233,
      "text": "lets you manage dependencies"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 11.8,
      "text": "versions and packages"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 13.233,
      "text": "without conflicts"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 14.2,
      "text": "across different projects"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 16.033,
      "text": "When you work on"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 16.7,
      "text": "multiple Python projects"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 18.1,
      "text": "it's likely that some of them depend"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 19.566,
      "text": "on different versions"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 20.533,
      "text": "of external libraries"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 21.9,
      "text": "or even Python itself"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 23.633,
      "text": "Without virtual environments"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 24.933,
      "text": "if you were to install"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 25.766,
      "text": "every dependency globally"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 27.366,
      "text": "you might run into issues"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 28.466,
      "text": "where one project"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 29.333,
      "text": "needs a different version"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 30.3,
      "text": "of a library than another project"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 32.266,
      "text": "This can lead to compatibility issues"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 34.566,
      "text": "Virtual environment solved"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 35.866,
      "text": "this issue by allowing each project"
    },
    {
      "startSeconds": 37.6,
